 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jGbM4skjGkUQ7kNvwFyjPcB&_nc_oc=AdrfYu9qX4CIPPkbTGv6gkXvkuwRUURLXFGVY9YQ5acraR9_bMhaH1KZtmFXbRDiHxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af44awwDnyo4K3zGo9oz6XSyOn0dwHO6GgXRGP2-gYyi7g&oe=6A19861E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IwpIuwy1RHkQ7kNvwE44m6W&_nc_oc=AdrXzfUqw5n0T_7iG9rE2WinhqRfwjCbNYfrLtrYS1zs3bI-ZjbO2N3ouQbL8NrGeu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71lBhpo0Kb4n2g7M-9eG_9azZjBBKnIMH5Z3AO-3mTkw&oe=6A19A3C1"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xW2WyROwqlkQ7kNvwHxtcU6&_nc_oc=AdrAX3_ehmvMRA5LYCXpXpHdjM4ZTkFVinwLhs2lNK2sIQmZhii1OF23xpyKTYSO03k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Tjxc98bF3jUuurMY3G8ylQgXKR70TTjrU1k-vr2y-Gw&oe=6A19B8BE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZzBerFXMIA4Q7kNvwFX4Z2b&_nc_oc=AdrQzHEvyQLhijPucsTLeCJ16_nqdKdCah_snUpYSSWDa6NTiZ6blBA3UCDHqrrh05E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7V7PeeChwfCdJTTyq-NozHUeAKRvS5tSWXS_IwfPG97g&oe=6A19BCE3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vDOy8V-8JWIQ7kNvwH9Di3v&_nc_oc=Adopccbg5Afp-xK2PLLQxBc5Dq2n-wxfI-ttk5sbaBC1eSW9yn8cDYNTRkfqBQd_JeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rpuQ3kIH8fG4ScD_KlDXdoRN95t-p-pUJF2ujM2XCVA&oe=6A198ABB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con